title: Payers › Test Workflow › Run a test case
route: /payers/summit?tab=test
intro: A made-up case goes through the same engine New Case uses, so the branches taken here are the branches a real case would take. The path lights up on a read-only canvas one step at a time, and the list beside it says in words what each step found. Nothing here is a real patient or touches a payer.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Test Workflow' in a payer's workspace\nor 'Test' in the builder"
screen top "Top card\n'Workflow to test' (name, version, status)\n'Run the test' and 'Reset the case'"
decision d1 "Did you pick a workflow, or arrive with one?"
process p1 "That workflow is used\n'You chose this workflow.'"
process p2 "The published workflow that matches the case is used\n'The published workflow that matches Residential 3.5, initial authorization.'\nNone matches: the first one, with a note"
screen pre "'Start from a made-up case'\nEight cases, one pick at a time (see the next diagram)"
screen frm "The case form in folds\n'The request', 'Coverage and authorization', 'Dates and existing authorization',\n'Documents on hand', 'Payer and portal', 'Approvals already given'"
input i1 "Change any fact: service, request type, coverage, benefit, requirement, network,\ndates, units, documents, payer answer, portal, days waiting, approvals"
screen cv "Canvas with the workflow, read only\n'Run the test to light up the path.'"
click c1 "Click 'Run the test'"
agent a1 "The engine runs the workflow on the case\nBranches are structured conditions over the facts, no model\nRules it reads keep their verification chip"
process p3 "The view scrolls to the canvas and results"
decision d2 "Does the person prefer reduced motion?"
process p4 "The whole path is shown at once"
process p5 "Each step lights up in order, about a third of a second apiece\nThe view follows the step that is running, then fits the path"
click c2 "Click 'Skip the animation'"
screen col "Colours and words on every step\nDone, Skipped, Failed, Waiting, Manual review, Pending, Not reached\nLines the run followed are drawn heavier"
screen res "'What happened'\nPill Published or 'Draft: not used for cases yet', the workflow and version\nOutcome pill and one sentence, 'Why it stopped'\nEach step: number, name, outcome, the sentence, rule chips, warnings"
screen rl "'Rules it read' with chips Verified, Needs review, Unverified, Superseded\n'N of these are not verified. A person should confirm them with the payer before relying on this result.'"
decision d3 "Did it stop before the end?"
click c3 "Click 'Fix in builder'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Test Workflow › Fix in builder"
click c4 "Click 'Run again'"
end e1 "The result is on screen with its path"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Test Workflow › Made-up cases"

s1 --> top --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| p1 --> pre
d1 -->|No| p2 --> pre
pre --> frm --> i1 --> cv
cv --> c1 --> a1 --> p3 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| p4 --> col
d2 -->|No| p5 --> col
p5 --> c2 --> col
col --> res --> rl --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| c3 --> g1
d3 -->|No| e1
res --> c4 --> a1
rl --> e1
pre --> g2
